## UI Craft: App navigation bar with Ctrl+K command palette

Stack: vanilla (HTML, CSS, JS) · Theme: light + dark · States: default, hover, focus-visible, selected, disabled, empty search with reset

**Tokens and architecture**
- This is a single component with no `design/` folder, so the cold-start gate was skipped. It uses the neutral default tokens with `design-system` names: `--color-surface-*`, `--glass-bg`, `--color-border-*`, `--color-text-*`, `--color-action-primary-bg`, `--r-*` and `--z-sticky/-dropdown/-command/-modal/-toast`.
- The palette is a native `<dialog>` opened with `showModal()`. The search field is a combobox over a listbox, using `aria-activedescendant`.
- Below 768px the links collapse into a 44px menu button and a drawer.
- Motion uses transform and opacity only (160–200ms) and is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.

